    "description": "Comprehensive production Postman collection for Stock Market AI Trend Forecasting, Quantitative Risk Analysis, Virtual Portfolios, and Sentiment Scoring.\n\n### Quick Start Guide:\n1. Ensure the backend is running (uvicorn backend.app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000).\n2. Run 'Authentication -> Login (Auto-Captures Bearer Token)'. The pre-configured test script will automatically store the JWT Bearer token into {{token}}.\n3. All authenticated requests (Portfolio, Watchlist, User Profile) will automatically inherit this Bearer token.\n4. You can use the exact same credentials (demotrader / demopass or newly registered users) in the React Web Application (http://localhost:5173 or http://localhost:3000).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
